/dev/sda1 /mnt vfat unknown_opt 0 0
/dev/sda2 /mnt vfat uid 0 0
/dev/sda3 /mnt vfat usefree=1 0 0
/dev/sda4 /mnt vfat uid=abc 0 0
/dev/sda5 /mnt vfat umask=999 0 0
/dev/sda6 /mnt vfat utf8=yesno 0 0
/dev/sda7 /mnt vfat check=z 0 0
/dev/sda8 /mnt vfat shortname=invalid 0 0
/dev/sda9 /mnt vfat tz=EST 0 0
/dev/sda10 /mnt vfat errors=invalid 0 0
/dev/sda11 /mnt vfat nfs=invalid 0 0

-- expected/validationerrors.txt --
Unknown vfat mount option 'unknown_opt' on line 2
Missing value for vfat mount option 'uid' on line 3
vfat mount option 'usefree' does not take a value on line 4
Invalid value 'abc' for vfat mount option 'uid' on line 5, must be an integer
Invalid value '999' for vfat mount option 'umask' on line 6, must be an octal integer
Invalid value 'yesno' for vfat mount option 'utf8' on line 7, must be a boolean (0, 1, yes, no, true, false)
Invalid value 'z' for vfat mount option 'check' on line 8 (only 's', 'r', or 'n' are supported)
Invalid value 'invalid' for vfat mount option 'shortname' on line 9
Invalid value 'EST' for vfat mount option 'tz' on line 10 (only 'UTC' is supported)
Invalid value 'invalid' for vfat mount option 'errors' on line 11
Invalid value 'invalid' for vfat mount option 'nfs' on line 12